   "subject": "Re: Shiny app on AWS-EC2 - Problem having access to a database",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Oh, that&#39;s the log for Shiny Server itself. <div><br></div><div>You need the logs for the application, which would be under the /var/log/shiny-server/ <b>directory</b>, named something like &lt;app-name-date-accessed&gt;.log</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
