     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">it looks like it is a permission issue with the database. If I am using a local file on the server I have access to my app <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:12.8px\">via </span><a href=\"http://35.182.36.104:3838/AVM_app\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://35.182.36.104:3838/AVM_app&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792388895069000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3moV1jFSYp-Gc0drkGTr1k\">http://35.182.36.104:3838/AVM_app</a></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">in the shiny-server.conf the user is run_as shiny<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">my app is located in /srv/shiny-server/AVM_app</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">and yes my app runs fine on that server</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">strange...</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">thanks!</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&quot;arial narrow&quot;,sans-serif;color:rgb(7,55,99)\">M.</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
